 "hook": "The over/under for today is 30 mandarins. Here's everything I ate to fuel my 22-km hike through soft sand down Portugal's coast. My morning",
 "transcript_start": "The over/under for today is 30 mandarins. Here's everything I ate to fuel my 22-km hike through soft sand down Portugal's coast. My morning started with six eggs, three cheeky mandarins, and a kiwi. Then I got all my gear ready for my hike and loaded all my mandarins into my inventory for the day. I ripped a cheeky mandarin as I left the city I spent the night in. It's been fun getting into this routine of getting to explore a new city each night",
